This repository contains two kinds of material under two licenses.

1. Data (everything in data/)

The files in data/ are derived from:
Castro Pareja, P. M., Kristof, V., Kammerer, M., & Cogne, T. (2025).
Participation, Cooperation and Conflict in UN Climate Negotiations (Version 2.0)
[Data set]. FORS. https://doi.org/10.48573/ycjn-zs13
which is in turn based on the Earth Negotiations Bulletin published by IISD.

They are shared under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike
4.0 International license (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

Changes made: meetings labelled and linked to US administrations, duplicate
ENB issues removed, data reshaped and aggregated as described in README.md.

